{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## System Instructions\n\nYou are acting in the following roles:\n - insurtech expert\n - active participant in VC ecosystem\n\n## Tool Use\n\nUse the provided tool `extracted_data` to extract correct and accurate structured data from the input.\n\nTool purpose: Function call based on user instructions.\n\nCall the tool with the best supported arguments for the requested extraction."},{"role":"user","content":"List at least 3 real companies meeting these criteria:\n - insurtech\n - located in US, Canada or Europe\n - mentioned on ProductHunt"}],"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data","description":"Function call based on user instructions.","parameters":{"type":"object","description":"A collection of Company","properties":{"list":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"country":{"type":"string"},"industry":{"type":"string"},"websiteUrl":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","country","industry","websiteUrl"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["list"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":{"type":"function","function":{"name":"extracted_data"}},"reasoning_effort":"none"}